1
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:08,233
RECEPTIONIST: Welcome to Calm Corp. Do you have an appointment?

2
00:00:08,433 --> 00:00:09,631
TIREDNESS: I'm here about the thing.

3
00:00:09,831 --> 00:00:10,638
RECEPTIONIST: What thing?

4
00:00:10,838 --> 00:00:11,641
TIREDNESS: Exactly.

5
00:00:12,141 --> 00:00:12,809
SECURITY: Badge?

6
00:00:13,009 --> 00:00:17,881
TIREDNESS: Fourth floor. Something's making a noise. They called me. I don't want to be here either.

7
00:00:19,281 --> 00:00:21,443
SECURITY: Yeah. You look like you don't want to be here.

8
00:00:24,243 --> 00:00:25,525
SCIENTIST: Excuse me. Who are you?

9
00:00:25,725 --> 00:00:27,456
TIREDNESS: Facilities. Checking the vibes.

10
00:00:27,656 --> 00:00:28,191
SCIENTIST: The what?

11
00:00:28,391 --> 00:00:29,769
TIREDNESS: They're fine. Keep it up.

12
00:00:29,969 --> 00:00:30,461
SCIENTIST: Thanks?

13
00:00:31,661 --> 00:00:34,061
[Subject 7. Escaped.]

14
00:00:35,061 --> 00:00:36,251
TIREDNESS: Oh. That's not great.

15
00:00:36,451 --> 00:00:39,180
TIREDNESS: So the thing in the cage was only a piece of it.

16
00:00:39,380 --> 00:00:40,943
TIREDNESS: The real one is still out there.

17
00:00:42,943 --> 00:00:43,699
TIREDNESS: Of course.

18
00:00:44,299 --> 00:00:45,459
SECURITY: STOP RIGHT THERE!

19
00:00:45,899 --> 00:00:47,294
TIREDNESS: Why is there always running?

20
00:00:49,599 --> 00:00:50,207
TIREDNESS: Nope.

21
00:00:51,707 --> 00:00:54,659
TIREDNESS (thinking): So this is how it ends. Tired, and falling.

22
00:00:55,759 --> 00:00:57,125
TIREDNESS (thinking): Honestly? Fair.

23
00:01:02,657 --> 00:01:03,167
TIREDNESS: Ow.

24
00:01:04,267 --> 00:01:05,077
TIREDNESS: Where am I?

25
00:01:05,277 --> 00:01:07,425
TIREDNESS: Why does everything smell like everything?

26
00:01:08,825 --> 00:01:10,537
TIREDNESS (thinking): Something is watching me.

27
00:01:13,037 --> 00:01:15,606
TIREDNESS (thinking): I can feel it. Moving behind the wall.

28
00:01:15,906 --> 00:01:18,019
TIREDNESS (thinking): That is not a normal thing to know.

29
00:01:19,169 --> 00:01:20,326
TIREDNESS: Nope. Nope. Nope.

30
00:01:20,526 --> 00:01:22,526
[He holds it. It can't get loose.]

31
00:01:25,526 --> 00:01:26,549
TIREDNESS: Are you cuddling me?

32
00:01:27,149 --> 00:01:29,749
[Neither of them knows what to do. They feel connected.]

33
00:01:30,549 --> 00:01:32,536
TIREDNESS: Why me? Why do I have a creature now?

34
00:01:34,649 --> 00:01:35,957
TIREDNESS: There's no way out of here.

35
00:01:36,157 --> 00:01:37,957
[It points left. Down. Into the dark.]

36
00:01:37,757 --> 00:01:39,703
TIREDNESS: No. Up is out. That way goes down.

37
00:01:40,903 --> 00:01:42,416
TIREDNESS: Okay. Okay! I get it!

38
00:01:42,903 --> 00:01:43,827
TIREDNESS: Fine. FINE.

39
00:01:46,927 --> 00:01:50,327
[A chamber as deep as a skyscraper is tall. Pod after pod after pod.]

40
00:01:54,527 --> 00:01:57,327
[Each pod holds a creature like this one. Asleep.]

41
00:01:57,327 --> 00:01:59,480
TIREDNESS: These are your family. Aren't they?

42
00:02:01,480 --> 00:02:03,127
TIREDNESS: Okay. I'm awake now.
